('Python Web Scraping', 'Learn to use Python for web scraping development', 'This course systematically explains the technologies and methods for using Python for web scraping development. From HTTP requests, HTML parsing to data storage, anti-scraping countermeasures, it comprehensively covers scraping development skills. Through multiple practice projects, it helps learners acquire the ability to independently develop scraping applications.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. HTTP protocol and request library usage\n2. HTML parsing and data extraction\n3. Data storage and management\n4. Anti-scraping strategies and countermeasures\n5. Scraping framework usage\n\nProject Practice:\n- News website scraper\n- E-commerce data collection\n- Batch image download', 'Intermediate', 'Programming Development', '/image/course/python-spider.jpg', 'Prof. Zhang', 'Prof. Zhang is a Python scraping technology expert with 10 years of scraping development experience. Proficient in various scraping frameworks and anti-scraping technologies, and has developed multiple large scraping projects. Teaching style focuses on hands-on practice, and has helped numerous learners master scraping development skills.', 249.00, 'Programming Development,Hands-on Practice,Independent Learning,Visual Learning,Skill Expansion', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Scraping Basics","lessons":[{"title":"HTTP Protocol Basics","duration":"50 min"},{"title":"Requests Library Usage","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"BeautifulSoup Parsing","duration":"80 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Data Extraction","lessons":[{"title":"XPath and CSS Selectors","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Regular Expressions","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Data Cleaning","duration":"70 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Data Storage","lessons":[{"title":"File Storage","duration":"60 min"},{"title":"Database Storage","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Data Deduplication","duration":"60 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Advanced Techniques","lessons":[{"title":"Scrapy Framework","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Anti-Scraping Countermeasures","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Distributed Scraping","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"News Website Scraper","duration":"180 min"},{"title":"E-commerce Data Collection","duration":"200 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/python-spider-1.jpg","/image/course/python-spider-2.jpg"]', '35 hours', 950, 4.6),
('Advanced TypeScript', 'In-depth learning of TypeScript type system and advanced features', 'This course thoroughly explains the TypeScript type system and advanced features. From basic types, generics to advanced types, decorators, it comprehensively covers TypeScript development skills. Through multiple practice projects, it helps learners build type-safe JavaScript applications.\n\nCourse Features:\n1. In-depth understanding of the type system\n2. Generic programming techniques\n3. Advanced type applications\n4. Engineering practices\n\nProject Practice:\n- Type-safe utility library\n- React + TypeScript project\n- Node.js + TypeScript application', 'Intermediate', 'Frontend Development', '/image/course/typescript.jpg', 'Prof. Chen', 'Prof. Chen is a TypeScript technology expert with 9 years of frontend development experience. Proficient in TypeScript type system and large frontend project architecture, and has led the development of multiple TypeScript projects. Teaching style is clear, focusing on type safety, and has helped numerous learners master TypeScript skills.', 299.00, 'Frontend Development,Reading & Writing,Independent Learning,Visual Learning,Skill Expansion', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: TypeScript Basics","lessons":[{"title":"TypeScript Environment Setup","duration":"40 min"},{"title":"Basic Type System","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Interfaces and Type Aliases","duration":"80 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Functions and Classes","lessons":[{"title":"Function Types","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Classes and Inheritance","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Decorators","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Generic Programming","lessons":[{"title":"Generics Basics","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Generic Constraints","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Conditional Types","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Advanced Types","lessons":[{"title":"Union Types and Intersection Types","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Mapped Types","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Utility Types","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"Type-Safe Utility Library","duration":"200 min"},{"title":"React + TypeScript Project","duration":"240 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/typescript-1.jpg","/image/course/typescript-2.jpg"]', '40 hours', 1100, 4.7),
('Docker Container Technology', 'Learn Docker containerized deployment and management', 'This course systematically explains Docker containerization technology. From Docker fundamentals, image building to container orchestration, CI/CD integration, it comprehensively covers Docker usage skills. Through multiple practice projects, it helps learners acquire containerized deployment capabilities.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Docker fundamentals and core concepts\n2. Image building and management\n3. Container running and management\n4. Docker Compose orchestration\n5. CI/CD integration practice\n\nProject Practice:\n- Web application containerization\n- Microservice container orchestration\n- Continuous integration and deployment', 'Intermediate', 'Professional Skills', '/image/course/docker.jpg', 'Prof. Zhao', 'Prof. Zhao is a container technology expert with 11 years of DevOps experience. Proficient in Docker, Kubernetes and other container technologies, and has led the containerization transformation of multiple large projects. Teaching style is pragmatic, focusing on hands-on practice, and has trained numerous DevOps engineers.', 349.00, 'Professional Skills,Hands-on Practice,Independent Learning,Visual Learning,Career Advancement', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Docker Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Docker Introduction and Installation","duration":"40 min"},{"title":"Images and Containers","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Dockerfile Writing","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Image Management","lessons":[{"title":"Image Building","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Image Optimization","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Image Registry Usage","duration":"60 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Container Management","lessons":[{"title":"Container Running","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Volume Management","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Network Configuration","duration":"70 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Docker Compose","lessons":[{"title":"Compose Basics","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Multi-Container Orchestration","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Service Dependency Management","duration":"70 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"Web Application Containerization","duration":"180 min"},{"title":"Microservice Container Orchestration","duration":"240 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/docker-1.jpg","/image/course/docker-2.jpg"]', '35 hours', 1000, 4.7),
('Business Data Analysis', 'Learn business data analysis and decision support', 'This course systematically explains business data analysis methods and tools. From data collection, analysis to visualization, decision support, it comprehensively covers business data analysis skills. Through multiple real cases, it helps learners improve their business decision-making capabilities.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Business data analysis fundamentals\n2. Data collection and organization\n3. Data analysis methods\n4. Data visualization\n5. Business decision support\n\nPractice Cases:\n- Sales data analysis\n- User behavior analysis\n- Market trend prediction', 'Intermediate', 'Business Management', '/image/course/business-analysis.jpg', 'Prof. Liu', 'Prof. Liu is a business data analysis expert with 14 years of business analysis experience. Has served as data analysis director at multiple well-known companies, specializing in business intelligence and decision support. Teaching style is pragmatic, focusing on case studies, and has helped numerous learners improve their business analysis capabilities.', 399.00, 'Business Management,Data Science,Reading & Writing,Independent Learning,Career Advancement', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Business Analysis Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Business Analysis Overview","duration":"40 min"},{"title":"Data Analysis Workflow","duration":"60 min"},{"title":"Business Indicator Design","duration":"70 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Data Collection","lessons":[{"title":"Data Source Identification","duration":"60 min"},{"title":"Data Collection Methods","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Data Quality Assessment","duration":"60 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Analysis Methods","lessons":[{"title":"Descriptive Analysis","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Diagnostic Analysis","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Predictive Analysis","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Data Visualization","lessons":[{"title":"Chart Selection Principles","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Dashboard Design","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Report Writing","duration":"80 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Practice Cases","lessons":[{"title":"Sales Data Analysis","duration":"200 min"},{"title":"User Behavior Analysis","duration":"180 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/business-analysis-1.jpg","/image/course/business-analysis-2.jpg"]', '40 hours', 1120, 4.7),
('Illustrator Vector Design', 'Master Illustrator vector graphics design techniques', 'This course systematically explains Illustrator vector graphics design techniques. From basic tools, path drawing to advanced effects, illustration creation, it comprehensively covers Illustrator design skills. Through multiple design project practices, it helps learners become professional vector designers.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Illustrator basic operations\n2. Path and shape drawing\n3. Color and gradient application\n4. Typography and layout\n5. Illustration and icon design\n\nProject Practice:\n- Logo design and creation\n- Vector illustration creation\n- Icon design', 'Elementary', 'Design & Creativity', '/image/course/illustrator.jpg', 'Prof. Sun', 'Prof. Sun is a senior vector designer with 13 years of design experience. Proficient in Illustrator, CorelDRAW and other vector design software, and has provided design services for many well-known brands. Teaching style is lively, focusing on creativity, and has helped numerous learners master professional design skills.', 199.00, 'Design & Creativity,Visual Learning,Hands-on Practice,Hobby & Interest', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Illustrator Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Interface and Tools","duration":"50 min"},{"title":"Document Creation and Management","duration":"40 min"},{"title":"Basic Drawing Tools","duration":"70 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Path Drawing","lessons":[{"title":"Pen Tool Usage","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Path Editing Techniques","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Shape Tool Applications","duration":"70 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Color and Effects","lessons":[{"title":"Color Fill and Stroke","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Gradients and Patterns","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Effects and Filters","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Typography","lessons":[{"title":"Text Tool Usage","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Typography Techniques","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Text Effects Creation","duration":"70 