:"100 min"},{"title":"Usability Testing","duration":"80 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"Mobile App Design","duration":"240 min"},{"title":"Web Product Design","duration":"200 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/product-design-1.jpg","/image/course/product-design-2.jpg"]', '42 hours', 1150, 4.7),
('Angular Framework Development', 'Learn Angular framework to build large-scale frontend applications', 'This course systematically explains Angular framework development technology. From component development, dependency injection to routing management, state management, it comprehensively covers Angular development skills. Through multiple large project practices, it helps learners build enterprise-level Angular applications.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Angular fundamentals and architecture\n2. Component and module development\n3. Services and dependency injection\n4. Routing and navigation\n5. State management and HTTP\n\nProject Practice:\n- Enterprise management system\n- E-commerce platform development\n- Data visualization application', 'Intermediate', 'Frontend Development', '/image/course/angular.jpg', 'Prof. Wu', 'Prof. Wu is an Angular technology expert with 11 years of frontend development experience. Proficient in Angular, RxJS and other technology stacks, and has participated in the development of multiple large Angular projects. Teaching style is clear, focusing on architecture design, and has helped numerous learners master Angular development skills.', 399.00, 'Frontend Development,Visual Learning,Hands-on Practice,Independent Learning,Skill Expansion', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Angular Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Angular Architecture Overview","duration":"60 min"},{"title":"Component Development Basics","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Template Syntax","duration":"80 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Component System","lessons":[{"title":"Component Communication","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Lifecycle Hooks","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Directive Usage","duration":"70 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Services and Dependency Injection","lessons":[{"title":"Service Creation","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Dependency Injection Mechanism","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"HTTP Services","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Routing and State","lessons":[{"title":"Route Configuration","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Route Guards","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"State Management","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"Enterprise Management System","duration":"300 min"},{"title":"E-commerce Platform Development","duration":"360 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/angular-1.jpg","/image/course/angular-2.jpg"]', '50 hours', 1250, 4.8),
