('Marketing Strategy', 'Learn digital marketing and brand promotion strategies', 'This course systematically explains digital marketing and brand promotion strategies. From market analysis, user insights to marketing channels, effectiveness evaluation, it comprehensively covers modern marketing skills. Through multiple real cases, it helps learners improve their marketing capabilities.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Marketing fundamentals\n2. Market analysis and user research\n3. Digital marketing channels\n4. Content marketing strategy\n5. Marketing effectiveness evaluation\n\nPractice Cases:\n- Brand promotion plan\n- Social media marketing\n- Marketing data analysis', 'Intermediate', 'Business Management', '/image/course/marketing.jpg', 'Prof. Li', 'Prof. Li is a marketing strategy expert with 16 years of marketing experience. Has served as marketing director at multiple well-known companies, specializing in digital marketing and brand promotion. Teaching style is pragmatic, focusing on case studies, and has helped numerous learners improve their marketing capabilities.', 299.00, 'Business Management,Social Learning,Reading & Writing,Visual Learning,Career Advancement', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Marketing Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Marketing Theory Overview","duration":"50 min"},{"title":"Market Analysis","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"User Insights","duration":"80 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Digital Marketing","lessons":[{"title":"SEO and SEM","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Social Media Marketing","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Content Marketing","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Brand Strategy","lessons":[{"title":"Brand Positioning","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Brand Communication","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Brand Management","duration":"80 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Effectiveness Evaluation","lessons":[{"title":"Marketing Indicator Design","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Data Analysis Methods","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"ROI Evaluation","duration