('Data Mining Technology', 'Learn data mining algorithms and practical applications', 'This course thoroughly explains data mining algorithms and practical application techniques. From data preprocessing, feature engineering to classification, clustering, association rule mining, it comprehensively covers data mining skills. Through multiple real projects, it helps learners acquire the ability to independently perform data mining.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Data mining fundamentals\n2. Data preprocessing techniques\n3. Classification algorithms\n4. Clustering algorithms\n5. Association rule mining\n\nProject Practice:\n- Customer segmentation analysis\n- Recommendation system development\n- Anomaly detection application', 'Advanced', 'Data Science', '/image/course/data-mining.jpg', 'Prof. Wang', 'Prof. Wang is a data mining expert with a doctoral degree and 15 years of data mining research experience. Proficient in various data mining algorithms and machine learning technologies, and has led multiple large data mining projects. Teaching style is rigorous, focusing on algorithm understanding, and has trained numerous data mining engineers.', 599.00, 'Data Science,Reading & Writing,Independent Learning,Hands-on Practice,Academic Advancement', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Data Mining Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Data Mining Overview","duration":"60 min"},{"title":"Data Preprocessing","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Feature Engineering","duration":"110 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Classification Algorithms","lessons":[{"title":"Decision Trees","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Naive Bayes","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Support Vector Machines","duration":"110 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Clustering Algorithms","lessons":[{"title":"K-means Clustering","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Hierarchical Clustering","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"DBSCAN","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Association Rules","lessons":[{"title":"Apriori Algorithm","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"FP