('Financial Management Fundamentals', 'Learn corporate financial management and analysis', 'This course systematically explains the fundamentals of corporate financial management and analysis. From financial statements, cost management to investment decisions, risk control, it comprehensively covers financial management skills. Through multiple real cases, it helps learners improve their financial management capabilities.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Financial management fundamentals\n2. Financial statement analysis\n3. Cost management\n4. Investment decisions\n5. Risk control\n\nPractice Cases:\n- Financial statement analysis\n- Investment project evaluation\n- Financial risk control', 'Intermediate', 'Business Management', '/image/course/finance.jpg', 'Prof. Zhou', 'Prof. Zhou is a financial management expert with 15 years of financial management experience. Has served as financial director at multiple large enterprises, proficient in financial analysis and investment decisions. Teaching style is pragmatic, focusing on case studies, and has helped numerous learners improve their financial management capabilities.', 299.00, 'Business Management,Reading & Writing,Independent Learning,Social Learning,Career Advancement', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Financial Management Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Financial Management Overview","duration":"50 min"},{"title":"Financial Goals","duration":"60 min"},{"title":"Financial Environment","duration":"50 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Financial Statements","lessons":[{"title":"Balance Sheet","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Income Statement","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Cash Flow Statement","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Financial Ratio Analysis","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Cost Management","lessons":[{"title":"Cost Accounting","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Cost Control","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Budget Management","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Investment Decisions","lessons":[{"title":"Investment Analysis Methods","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Capital Budgeting","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Risk Assessment","duration":"80 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Practice Cases","lessons":[{"title":"Financial Statement Analysis","duration":"200 min"},{"title":"Investment Project Evaluation","duration":"180 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/finance-1.jpg","/image/course/finance-2.jpg"]', '40 hours', 1080, 4.7),
('Kubernetes Container Orchestration', 'Learn Kubernetes container orchestration and management', 'This course thoroughly explains Kubernetes container orchestration and management technology. From cluster deployment, Pod management to service discovery, auto-scaling, it comprehensively covers Kubernetes usage skills. Through multiple large project practices, it helps learners build enterprise-level containerized platforms.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Kubernetes architecture and core concepts\n2. Pod and container management\n3. Service and Ingress\n4. Configuration and storage management\n5. Monitoring and logging\n\nProject Practice:\n- Microservice container orchestration\n- High-availability cluster deployment\n- CI/CD integration', 'Advanced', 'Professional Skills', '/image/course/kubernetes.jpg', 'Prof. Zhao', 'Prof. Zhao is a Kubernetes technology expert with 13 years of container technology experience. Proficient in Kubernetes, Docker and other container technologies, and has led the deployment and management of multiple large K8s clusters. Teaching style is in-depth, focusing on hands-on practice, and has trained numerous Kubernetes engineers.', 599.00, 'Professional Skills,Hands-on Practice,Independent Learning,Reading & Writing,Career Advancement', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Kubernetes Basics","lessons":[{"title":"K8s Architecture Overview","duration":"70 min"},{"title":"Cluster Deployment","duration":"120 min"},{"title":"Core Concepts","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Pod Management","lessons":[{"title":"Pod Creation and Management","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Deployment","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"StatefulSet","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Service Management","lessons":[{"title":"Service","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Ingress","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Service Discovery","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Advanced Features","lessons":[{"title":"Configuration Management","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Storage Management","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Auto-Scaling","duration":"120 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"Microservice Container Orchestration","duration":"400 min"},{"title":"High-Availability Cluster Deployment","duration":"360 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/kubernetes-1.jpg","/image/course/kubernetes-2.jpg","/image/course/kubernetes-3.jpg"]', '70 hours', 1750, 4.9),
('Swift iOS Development', 'Learn Swift language and iOS application development', 'This course systematically explains Swift language and iOS application development technology. From Swift syntax, UIKit to SwiftUI, Core Data, it comprehensively covers iOS development skills. Through multiple iOS project practices, it helps learners build professional iOS applications.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Swift language fundamentals\n2. UIKit interface development\n3. SwiftUI modern UI framework\n4. Data persistence\n5. Network requests and API integration\n\nProject Practice:\n- Todo App\n- Weather application\n- Social application development', 'Intermediate', 'Programming Development', '/image/course/swift.jpg', 'Prof. Li', 'Prof. Li is an iOS development expert with 11 years of iOS development experience. Proficient in Swift, Objective-C and iOS development technologies, and has developed multiple successfully published iOS applications. Teaching style is clear, focusing on hands-on practice, and has helped numerous learners master iOS development skills.', 449.00, 'Programming Development,Hands-on Practice,Visual Learning,Independent Learning,Skill Expansion', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Swift Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Swift Syntax","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Object-Oriented Programming","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Closures and Protocols","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: UIKit Development","lessons":[{"title":"Interface Building","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"View Controllers","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Navigation and Transitions","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: SwiftUI","lessons":[{"title":"SwiftUI Basics","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"State Management","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Data Binding","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Data and Networking","lessons":[{"title":"Core Data","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Network Requests","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"JSON Parsing","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"Todo App","duration":"300 min"},{"title":"Weather Application","duration":"280 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/swift-1.jpg","/image/course/swift-2.jpg"]', '50 hours', 1280, 4.8),
('Kotlin Android Development', 'Develop Android applications with Kotlin', 'This course systematically explains the technology for developing Android applications with Kotlin. From Kotlin syntax, Android fundamentals to Jetpack components, MVVM architecture, it comprehensively covers Android development skills. Through multiple Android project practices, it helps learners build professional Android applications.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Kotlin language fundamentals\n2. Android basic components\n3. Jetpack component library\n4. MVVM architecture\n5. Data persistence and networking\n\nProject Practice:\n- News reader App\n- Music player\n- E-commerce application development', 'Intermediate', 'Programming Development', '/image/course/kotlin.jpg', 'Prof. Wang', 'Prof. Wang is an Android development expert with 12 years of Android development experience. Proficient in Kotlin, Java and Android development technologies, and has developed multiple successfully published Android applications. Teaching style is clear, focusing on architecture design, and has helped numerous learners master Android development skills.', 449.00, 'Programming Development,Hands-on Practice,Visual Learning,Independent Learning,Skill Expansion', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Kotlin Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Kotlin Syntax","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Object-Oriented Programming","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Extension Functions","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Android Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Activity and Fragment","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Layout System","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Lifecycle","duration":"90 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Jetpack Components","lessons":[{"title":"ViewModel","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"LiveData","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Room Database","duration":"110 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Architecture Design","lessons":[{"title":"MVVM Architecture","duration":"120 min"},{"title":"Dependency Injection","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Network Requests","duration":"110 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"News Reader App","duration":"360 min"},{"title":"Music Player","duration":"320 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/kotlin-1.jpg","/image/course/kotlin-2.jpg"]', '52 hours', 1320, 4.8),
('Flutter Cross-Platform Development', 'Develop cross-platform mobile applications with Flutter', 'This course systematically explains the technology for developing cross-platform mobile applications with Flutter. From Dart language, Widget system to state management, platform interaction, it comprehensively covers Flutter development skills. Through multiple cross-platform project practices, it helps learners build iOS and Android applications.\n\nCourse Content:\n1. Dart language fundamentals\n2. Flutter Widget system\n3. State management (Provider/Bloc)\n4. Routing and navigation\n5. Platform interaction and plugins\n\nProject Practice:\n- Todo App\n- E-commerce application\n- Social application development', 'Intermediate', 'Programming Development', '/image/course/flutter.jpg', 'Prof. Zhang', 'Prof. Zhang is a Flutter development expert with 10 years of mobile development experience. Proficient in Flutter, Dart and cross-platform development technologies, and has developed multiple successful cross-platform applications. Teaching style is clear, focusing on hands-on practice, and has helped numerous learners master Flutter development skills.', 399.00, 'Programming Development,Frontend Development,Hands-on Practice,Visual Learning,Skill Expansion', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Flutter Basics","lessons":[{"title":"Dart Language","duration":"80 min"},{"title":"Flutter Environment Setup","duration":"60 min"},{"title":"First Flutter Application","duration":"70 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Widget System","lessons":[{"title":"Basic Widgets","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Layout Widgets","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Custom Widgets","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: State Management","lessons":[{"title":"StatefulWidget","duration":"90 min"},{"title":"Provider State Management","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Bloc Pattern","duration":"120 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Advanced Features","lessons":[{"title":"Route Navigation","duration":"100 min"},{"title":"Platform Interaction","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Plugin Usage","duration":"100 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 5: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"Todo App","duration":"300 min"},{"title":"E-commerce Application","duration":"360 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/flutter-1.jpg","/image/course/flutter-2.jpg"]', '48 hours', 1200, 4.7),
('Rust Systems Programming', 'Learn Rust language for system-level programming', 'This course systematically explains the core technologies and development practices of Rust systems programming. From basic syntax, core concepts to advanced features, project practice, it comprehensively covers Rust systems programming development skills. Through multiple real project cases, it helps learners acquire the ability to independently develop applications.
Course Features:
1. Systematic learning path, from beginner to advanced
2. Rich practice projects for practical application
3. In-depth explanation of core principles and best practices
4. Professional instructor team guidance
After completing this course, you will be able to:
- Master Rust systems programming core skills
- Be able to independently complete project development
- Understand best practices and design patterns
- Have the ability to solve practical problems', 'Advanced', 'Programming Development', '/image/course/rust.jpg', 'Prof. Chen', 'Prof. Chen is a senior technical development engineer with 15 years of development experience. Has served as a senior engineer at several well-known companies, specializing in Rust systems programming. Teaching style is lively and interesting, and has trained numerous technical development engineers.', 499.00, 'Programming Development,Reading & Writing,Independent Learning,Hands-on Practice,Academic Advancement', '[{"title":"Chapter 1: Theoretical Foundations","lessons":[{"title":"Rust Systems Programming Overview","duration":"60 min"},{"title":"Core Principles","duration":"88 min"},{"title":"Architecture Design","duration":"93 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 2: Core Technology","lessons":[{"title":"Core Algorithms","duration":"106 min"},{"title":"Implementation Methods","duration":"110 min"},{"title":"Optimization Techniques","duration":"104 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 3: Advanced Applications","lessons":[{"title":"Advanced Features","duration":"118 min"},{"title":"Performance Optimization","duration":"120 min"},{"title":"Architecture Design","duration":"118 min"}]},{"title":"Chapter 4: Project Practice","lessons":[{"title":"Rust Systems Programming Project Development","duration":"362 min"},{"title":"Rust Systems Programming Project Development","duration":"314 min"}]}]', '["/image/course/rust-系统编程-1.jpg","/image/course/rust-系统编程-2.jpg"]', '51 hours', 872, 4.8),
('Scala Functional Programming', 'Learn Scala functional programming paradigm', 'This course systematically explains the core technologies and development practices of Scala functional programming. From basic syntax, core concepts to advanced features, project practice, it comprehensively covers Scala functional programming development skills. Through multiple real project cases, it helps learners acquire the ability to independently develop applications.
Course Features:
1. Systematic learning path, from beginner to advanced
